WEBVTT

00:08.820 --> 00:15.580
In the deepest darkness lie the sleeping butterflies.

00:16.970 --> 00:23.520
Are they even aware of the blue sky?

00:25.130 --> 00:28.550
The world is fragile, like building blocks.

00:28.680 --> 00:32.530
I want a way to fly away.

00:32.890 --> 00:36.260
I pray for only one thing

00:36.740 --> 00:40.650
for the one that I love.

00:42.430 --> 00:46.380
Now, the dices were thrown.

00:46.440 --> 00:50.390
Paradise will rise in the future.

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I Tooi yumeni musubareru

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I will unite in this far away dream.

00:54.700 --> 00:58.430
And we will cross this red river.

00:58.490 --> 01:02.230
The flower embraces the cross with uncertainty.

01:02.490 --> 01:06.390
Like that, bloomed a fickle angel.

01:06.390 --> 01:10.460
We will one day find eternal love

01:10.710 --> 01:14.760
and I will give you Paradise.

01:33.050 --> 01:34.350
The force of darkness and...

01:34.970 --> 01:36.390
the force of light.

01:42.110 --> 01:44.150
The evil stone, Dark Bring

01:45.190 --> 01:47.280
and the holy stone, Rave.

01:49.910 --> 01:52.700
The war between the wondrous
stones of darkness and light...

01:53.240 --> 01:56.370
was supposed to be put
to an end on that day.

02:04.840 --> 02:07.180
This is... the last...

02:07.220 --> 02:09.070
Dark Bring!

02:28.400 --> 02:29.990
This massive explosion...

02:30.450 --> 02:33.870
destroyed 1/10 of the world.

02:35.370 --> 02:37.580
It was known as Overdrive.

02:38.870 --> 02:40.910
Dark Bring hid its existence and...

02:41.290 --> 02:44.630
Rave also disseminated throughout the world.

02:45.380 --> 02:48.380
And now 50 years have passed.

03:00.600 --> 03:02.480
Explosion!

03:14.590 --> 03:15.620
Good job, Plue!

03:27.380 --> 03:28.550
I'm Haru.

03:29.210 --> 03:30.800
This is Plue.

03:31.970 --> 03:33.220
I'm...

03:33.980 --> 03:35.140
Elie.

03:36.760 --> 03:38.680
It most definitely was the power of Rave.

03:39.430 --> 03:41.140
The one who controlled it...

03:42.560 --> 03:44.900
That guy... he must be Rave's successor.

03:46.330 --> 03:52.260
Shuda of the fire flame.

03:55.750 --> 03:57.660
Out, out, out of our way!

04:02.160 --> 04:04.460
Finally, I can get out of this damn town!

04:06.750 --> 04:07.500
Listen!

04:07.580 --> 04:10.250
Shuda himself has arrived here.

04:10.500 --> 04:14.970
So, don't let that boy and girl
with the strange dog get away.

04:15.050 --> 04:16.010
Yes!

04:20.220 --> 04:22.990
Oh, no! The guys from
Demon Card are over there.

04:37.360 --> 04:39.530
Hey, did you hear something around here?

04:45.870 --> 04:47.250
Are you ok, Elie?

04:47.580 --> 04:48.920
I hurt my butt...

04:49.540 --> 04:51.520
What on the earth have happened?

04:52.550 --> 04:54.010
We fell down from there.

05:01.350 --> 05:02.140
Huh? Where is Plue?

05:02.470 --> 05:03.640
Hey, Plue!

05:06.230 --> 05:06.980
Plue?

05:09.690 --> 05:10.650
Hey you!

05:11.270 --> 05:14.110
Why are you under my butt?

05:14.690 --> 05:17.430
Elie, you sat down on him
on purpose, didn't you?

05:19.160 --> 05:20.800
Huh? Is there someone else here?

05:22.910 --> 05:23.750
Who is it?!

05:23.790 --> 05:25.830
It hurts...

05:27.580 --> 05:30.180
I got a dump... shit...

05:34.800 --> 05:35.880
Is that a guy?

05:36.800 --> 05:38.180
Or maybe a girl?!

05:39.090 --> 05:42.010
Man, you can't even tell such a simple thing?

05:42.850 --> 05:44.760
Yeah, Haru, it's easy.

05:45.180 --> 05:46.520
Looking at it from every angle...

05:47.480 --> 05:48.560
It must be a mole!

05:50.020 --> 05:51.330
I am not a mole!

05:51.350 --> 05:54.070
Something that lives
underground is called a mole!

05:54.320 --> 05:56.820
If that's the case, then earthworms
and crickets are moles, right?

05:57.110 --> 05:59.830
Sounds like you guys are really similar...

05:59.840 --> 06:02.310
Damn... Where did they go?

06:02.350 --> 06:05.200
Those kind of kids can hide anywhere...

06:05.370 --> 06:07.200
Just like moles.

06:07.300 --> 06:08.870
We are not moles!

06:08.870 --> 06:10.120
Those are the guys from Demon Card.

06:12.130 --> 06:16.630
Every route that leads out
of this town is barricaded.

06:17.090 --> 06:19.300
They didn't show up at any of those routes...

06:19.420 --> 06:21.970
Which means they must still
be in this town, somewhere.

06:22.050 --> 06:25.890
No matter what, I'll get the fame of
catching them before Shuda does.

06:26.600 --> 06:29.760
It won't do us any good
being placed on lookout here.

06:29.760 --> 06:30.470
Let's go.

06:34.940 --> 06:38.080
You guys... Are you guys being
chased by Demon Card?

06:38.820 --> 06:39.440
Well... Sort of.

06:40.610 --> 06:41.910
Oh, I see.

06:42.200 --> 06:46.830
I heard that a couple with a strange
dog caused a riot at the dog races...

06:46.910 --> 06:48.500
Those were you guys.

06:48.500 --> 06:50.830
No... Couple? We aren't...

06:50.840 --> 06:51.750
No, right?

06:51.750 --> 06:54.000
He's only seen my panties.

06:54.180 --> 06:58.090
It's been a long time since I've heard
news here. That was refreshing!

06:58.090 --> 07:00.880
The members of the Demon Card
are annoying, aren't they?

07:01.420 --> 07:02.300
My name is Hole.

07:03.390 --> 07:05.470
People call me The Releaser, Hole.

07:05.800 --> 07:06.810
I'm Elie.

07:07.510 --> 07:08.350
I'm Haru.

07:08.600 --> 07:09.470
This is Plue.

07:10.980 --> 07:12.140
By the way, umm...

07:13.020 --> 07:14.520
Which are you? A guy or a girl?

07:19.610 --> 07:20.820
Now you should know.

07:21.070 --> 07:23.990
You are a guy with a long blond hair!

07:27.180 --> 07:28.130
Oh, I understand now.

07:28.870 --> 07:29.410
Hey!

07:29.740 --> 07:32.870
Have you seen a guy and a girl
with a strange dog around?

07:33.670 --> 07:34.710
Huh? No, I haven't.

07:35.540 --> 07:39.040
Really? Really, really, really?

07:39.220 --> 07:41.050
It's not good for you to hide them from us.

07:41.090 --> 07:44.970
Don't you know that we are
members of Demon Card?

07:45.340 --> 07:46.470
R-really...

07:46.550 --> 07:48.980
Those eyes are telling me that you're lying.

07:49.260 --> 07:50.420
No!

07:50.600 --> 07:51.520
You are lying, right?

07:51.730 --> 07:53.690
If you admit that you're
lying, I'll spare your life.

07:55.850 --> 07:58.150
Lie... Yes, that was a lie...

08:01.070 --> 08:03.170
Now, tell us. Where did they go?

08:03.210 --> 08:05.440
I told you already, I don't
know where they went.

08:06.570 --> 08:08.660
Really... Really?

08:08.690 --> 08:10.040
Stop lying now!

08:13.960 --> 08:15.500
Shuda!

08:15.960 --> 08:18.880
We were looking for that
guy and girl right now.

08:19.170 --> 08:21.090
We will find them soon.

08:22.050 --> 08:23.170
Map...

08:25.010 --> 08:26.970
Bring a map of this town to me.

08:28.260 --> 08:31.310
When I was trying to make
a hole for an escape route,

08:31.430 --> 08:34.720
you guys suddenly came crashing
down. I was so surprised.

08:35.940 --> 08:37.130
Well, this is my house.

08:37.140 --> 08:38.620
Come in.

08:40.190 --> 08:41.690
After all she is a mole, right?

08:41.940 --> 08:43.150
Hurry up!

08:44.650 --> 08:45.490
Go ahead.

08:45.570 --> 08:46.700
Elie, go ahead.

08:59.040 --> 09:00.670
Wow, it's pretty big inside.

09:01.000 --> 09:02.500
You said earlier that you're The Releaser, but...

09:02.670 --> 09:04.340
What do you do in a place like this?

09:04.340 --> 09:06.110
I dig tunnels and

09:06.110 --> 09:09.260
and help people who are being chased by
the Demon Card, people just like you,

09:09.260 --> 09:11.680
escape from this town.

09:12.470 --> 09:14.140
Isn't this your job?

09:14.430 --> 09:16.850
But we don't have money.

09:17.140 --> 09:17.850
It's ok.

09:18.270 --> 09:20.360
There are some people who pay me for it, but

09:20.770 --> 09:22.400
most of the time I volunteer because

09:22.690 --> 09:27.280
it's fun to surprise and upset
the Demon Card members!

09:27.580 --> 09:28.200
Uh-huh...

09:28.530 --> 09:31.490
Well, for the time being, you
guys should be safe here.

09:31.950 --> 09:34.620
After you guys rest, I can
take you out of this town.

09:35.160 --> 09:36.710
Let see... Why don't you sit down?

09:38.420 --> 09:39.290
Where did you guys come from?

09:39.710 --> 09:41.840
You were saying that you aren't a couple?

09:42.380 --> 09:45.170
I came from Garage Island.

09:45.760 --> 09:47.630
I just met Elie in this town.

09:47.880 --> 09:48.800
Garage Island?

09:48.970 --> 09:50.140
I never heard of it.

09:50.760 --> 09:52.390
It's a small island, so..

09:52.640 --> 09:54.850
Why did you leave your island to come

09:54.970 --> 09:57.100
to a place like this?

09:58.940 --> 09:59.640
I came...

10:01.190 --> 10:02.520
To collect Rave..

10:03.150 --> 10:04.940
in order to destroy the Demon Card.

10:23.630 --> 10:24.460
Haru...

10:24.710 --> 10:26.130
That is Rave.

10:26.550 --> 10:27.380
Rave?

10:28.340 --> 10:29.090
This is?

10:29.850 --> 10:31.180
Yes. A long time ago,

10:31.190 --> 10:35.720
there was only one person in the
world who could handle Rave.

10:35.720 --> 10:38.330
I was the only one for 50 years.

10:41.770 --> 10:45.520
But when I was defeated by
that guy just a little while ago,

10:45.900 --> 10:48.190
I couldn't use Rave.

10:48.860 --> 10:49.900
Do you understand?

10:51.660 --> 10:54.370
It's because a successor has appeared.

10:57.200 --> 10:58.120
Shiba...

10:58.620 --> 10:59.700
That's what Rave is?

11:00.740 --> 11:02.820
Yeah, it's only one, which isn't enough.

11:03.710 --> 11:07.780
I've been looking for the ones
scattered around the world.

11:08.760 --> 11:09.130
I see.

11:10.170 --> 11:13.150
Haru, we're both looking for something.

11:14.050 --> 11:15.300
What? Then, Elie, you are too?

11:16.070 --> 11:18.060
Um... I don't quite get it, but

11:18.430 --> 11:20.930
you guys seem to have mutual interests.

11:21.560 --> 11:23.730
Anyway, just a while ago they
were talking about Shuda...

11:23.900 --> 11:26.020
You'd better watch out for him.

11:26.480 --> 11:27.190
Shuda...

11:28.110 --> 11:29.650
I don't know that much about him, but

11:30.360 --> 11:32.570
he seems to be an executive
of the Demon Card.

11:39.540 --> 11:40.700
I found it.

11:41.160 --> 11:42.960
The place where they are hiding...

12:02.560 --> 12:03.600
Let's go!

12:05.850 --> 12:06.400
Hurry!

12:06.400 --> 12:07.100
Yes!

12:09.610 --> 12:11.910
Those kids won't be able to get away now.

12:19.870 --> 12:22.610
Seems like one of them is a smart fox.

12:23.000 --> 12:24.320
Who? Member of the Demon Card?

12:25.460 --> 12:26.120
Follow me!

12:34.670 --> 12:35.890
What are you doing?

12:36.010 --> 12:36.820
Hurry!

12:42.220 --> 12:44.060
What? This is a dead end.

12:44.680 --> 12:46.810
This is the place I've been working on.

12:49.860 --> 12:51.360
Amazing!

12:54.690 --> 12:56.780
This is the tunnel that I dug before.

12:57.320 --> 12:58.450
If we keep on heading this way,

12:58.450 --> 13:01.700
we can escape without getting
caught by the Demon Card.

13:01.700 --> 13:02.330
Let's go!

13:05.790 --> 13:07.290
Indeed, she is a releaser!

13:07.670 --> 13:08.790
Look! Look for them!

13:10.210 --> 13:12.440
They are definitely somewhere in here.

13:12.480 --> 13:13.480
Ryusha!

13:13.480 --> 13:14.460
What is it?

13:14.460 --> 13:16.630
There is a tunnel here.

13:19.850 --> 13:22.260
The guys from Demon Card should
be catching up with us any time now.

13:22.470 --> 13:24.570
Hole, are we there yet?

13:25.300 --> 13:26.400
Just a little bit more!

13:26.520 --> 13:28.560
Hurry! They're going find us!

13:32.680 --> 13:35.720
See? Here is another tunnel I've dug before.

13:36.190 --> 13:38.020
From here, you can reach the port.

13:38.280 --> 13:41.220
If you walk along the seaside,
you can get out of this town.

13:41.660 --> 13:42.710
Great!

13:43.030 --> 13:44.770
Then, I'll get going.

13:45.080 --> 13:47.240
I'll give them the slip.

13:48.080 --> 13:49.130
Thank you!

13:52.020 --> 13:52.620
Damn!

13:52.630 --> 13:53.960
What the hell is this hole?!

14:00.550 --> 14:01.260
Here we are!

14:12.270 --> 14:14.020
Good job.

14:18.700 --> 14:19.110
Hole!

14:19.610 --> 14:20.700
What's going on?

14:30.330 --> 14:33.040
Hey, tell them not to touch
me with these dirty hands!

14:33.500 --> 14:34.340
Bitch!

14:34.380 --> 14:36.940
What makes you think you can
speak to Shuda that way?

14:37.860 --> 14:38.940
Shuda.

14:39.670 --> 14:41.430
Her execution will be held later.

14:41.590 --> 14:42.760
Execution?!

14:43.050 --> 14:48.640
Those who go against Demon Card cannot
be forgiven, not even women and children.

14:49.100 --> 14:50.590
Shit!

14:52.100 --> 14:55.320
The one who does
whatever he wants by force...

14:55.650 --> 14:57.000
Is a bad guy.

14:57.210 --> 14:58.950
So my sister said!

15:05.240 --> 15:08.040
The legendary sword, the Ten Commandments...

15:09.500 --> 15:13.040
There is no mistake, you're the one who
got it from the powerful Shiba,

15:13.920 --> 15:16.670
you are the successor of Rave.

15:17.710 --> 15:19.420
If so, then what?

15:20.920 --> 15:22.520
Leave this one to me guys.

15:25.300 --> 15:27.260
This is my prey.

15:27.600 --> 15:29.390
It's not going be as easy as you think!

15:31.520 --> 15:32.600
Looking for me?

15:33.190 --> 15:34.020
Here!

15:36.190 --> 15:37.070
Where is he?

15:43.200 --> 15:43.860
Ouch...

15:44.490 --> 15:45.240
Alright!

15:45.450 --> 15:46.580
See, kid!?

15:46.660 --> 15:48.910
This is Shuda's Dark Bring!

15:49.740 --> 15:52.500
Hot... What is this?! It wont go away.

15:52.720 --> 15:53.600
Haru!

16:01.670 --> 16:02.770
How is it?

16:02.770 --> 16:05.470
It will keep you dancing till you die...

16:05.470 --> 16:06.750
It's Balzer's Flame.

16:07.350 --> 16:08.620
It feels good, doesn't it?

16:12.270 --> 16:14.230
Haru, count on me!
I'll save you!

16:16.560 --> 16:18.060
Oh, no! No bullets!

16:18.230 --> 16:20.730
Shall I finish him now?

16:33.310 --> 16:34.480
No!

16:34.790 --> 16:36.490
You missed him!

16:42.170 --> 16:45.590
Although you are the successor
of Rave, you are just a mere kid.

16:50.740 --> 16:51.770
It's over!

17:00.270 --> 17:01.020
Shit!

17:13.330 --> 17:14.590
No, not the Dark Bring!

17:14.800 --> 17:15.500
Haru!

17:18.900 --> 17:19.200
Haru...

17:20.840 --> 17:22.050
Thanks to the water, the fire is gone now.

17:39.600 --> 17:41.190
Kid, what's your name?

17:42.360 --> 17:43.190
Haru!

17:43.780 --> 17:45.020
Haru Glory!

17:45.400 --> 17:46.280
What?!

17:46.990 --> 17:49.360
Haru... Glory?!

17:49.950 --> 17:50.530
That's right.

17:51.410 --> 17:52.160
It can't be...

17:53.290 --> 17:54.830
Can he be Gale's son?!

17:56.870 --> 18:00.420
His son is the successor!?

18:01.250 --> 18:03.130
You knew my father?

18:04.250 --> 18:06.210
So, he is Gale's son...

18:07.800 --> 18:10.300
This is getting very interesting.

18:10.890 --> 18:12.430
Where is my father now?

18:13.260 --> 18:14.140
I don't know.

18:25.320 --> 18:26.990
Hey, you guys, let's go home.

18:27.190 --> 18:28.240
Shuda!

18:28.240 --> 18:30.560
Rave is in front of your eyes... Why?

18:31.720 --> 18:33.620
As long as my Dark Bring is broken,

18:34.030 --> 18:35.790
I can't beat his Rave.

18:36.500 --> 18:40.620
Besides, if he is Gale's son,
I don't wan to kill him now.

18:41.040 --> 18:43.380
I want to wait a little longer
and see how things will turn out.

18:44.210 --> 18:45.210
Wait!

18:53.890 --> 18:55.220
I said wait!

18:55.720 --> 18:57.470
Tell me about my father!

19:07.350 --> 19:10.150
Ryusha, which way should we go?

19:10.360 --> 19:11.910
Looks like we got lost.

19:14.730 --> 19:18.010
Take care, Haru, Elie and Plue!

19:18.370 --> 19:19.400
You too!

19:19.580 --> 19:20.320
See ya!

19:35.430 --> 19:37.060
It broke!

19:37.120 --> 19:38.370
Nooooo!

19:38.520 --> 19:40.640
Why don't you just buy a new one?

19:41.060 --> 19:42.350
It's not that easy!

19:42.890 --> 19:44.770
This is a legendary sword!

19:45.130 --> 19:46.270
No one sells this anywhere!

19:46.360 --> 19:48.230
Then you should fix it.

19:48.900 --> 19:50.290
Fix this?!

19:50.530 --> 19:52.020
If you go to Punk Street,

19:52.020 --> 19:53.390
you'll find a place to fix it.

19:53.430 --> 19:54.820
Pu.. Punk Street?

19:55.300 --> 19:55.780
Yeah.

19:56.200 --> 19:58.530
That is the biggest weapons
market in the world.

19:58.750 --> 20:03.020
I heard there is a legendary
blacksmith called Musica there.

20:03.740 --> 20:04.410
Musica...

20:04.950 --> 20:07.120
Where is this Punk street?

20:07.870 --> 20:09.500
I'll take you there.

20:10.460 --> 20:11.210
Really?

20:11.580 --> 20:13.830
Ok, let's go to Punk Street!

20:14.080 --> 20:14.960
Oh, yeah, Elie,

20:15.630 --> 20:16.340
a little while ago,

20:16.420 --> 20:19.460
you said you were also
looking for something, right?

20:19.460 --> 20:19.880
Let's go together!

20:20.380 --> 20:23.260
I'll help you find what you're looking for.

20:24.430 --> 20:25.180
Thank you...

20:28.600 --> 20:30.060
But... it's ok...

20:30.810 --> 20:32.060
Why?

20:32.390 --> 20:34.230
You told me about Musica, so...

20:34.730 --> 20:37.480
I will definitely help you find
what you're looking for.

20:38.250 --> 20:38.700
Uh-huh

20:39.320 --> 20:40.280
No...

20:40.990 --> 20:44.530
It's not like that, what I'm looking for
can't be found easily.

20:48.200 --> 20:49.950
What I'm looking for is...

20:50.660 --> 20:51.960
My memory.

20:53.000 --> 20:53.920
Memory?

20:55.380 --> 20:57.420
Beyond a year ago...

20:58.300 --> 20:59.750
I can't remember anything...

21:02.720 --> 21:05.340
That's why I travel around the world.

21:05.680 --> 21:09.140
I feel like I may meet someone who knows me.

21:09.850 --> 21:11.350
How did you lose your memory?

21:12.390 --> 21:13.940
If I knew that...

21:14.560 --> 21:15.650
I wouldn't be suffering...

21:20.400 --> 21:21.860
Let's find it together!

21:24.450 --> 21:25.950
Two people can find it
faster that one person can.

21:26.410 --> 21:27.410
Memory, right?

21:31.040 --> 21:31.790
I also...

21:32.540 --> 21:35.040
...forget a lot of things quickly,

21:35.580 --> 21:37.670
but I suddenly remember things sometimes.

21:38.670 --> 21:39.960
Elie's memory, too...

21:39.960 --> 21:41.960
The key is somewhere...

21:42.880 --> 21:43.550
Key?

21:43.880 --> 21:44.510
Yep!

21:45.010 --> 21:47.470
It may be hard to find,

21:47.970 --> 21:49.760
but it's the key that opens our doors.

21:50.970 --> 21:52.560
We will definitely find it some day!

21:56.750 --> 21:57.100
Yes.

21:57.400 --> 21:58.100
Thank you!

21:58.560 --> 22:01.820
Then, let's go to Punk street!

22:13.620 --> 22:23.950
Under the moon, I became a chrysalis, kissed upon a glass sea of love.

22:23.950 --> 22:33.890
Your rhythm is like a wave, embraced by the words of its song.

22:33.890 --> 22:44.020
Live to feel me, my past disappears on the water's surface.

22:44.520 --> 22:54.630
Everything I believed in, I found with you, so...

22:54.630 --> 23:04.860
You're wings on my heart kono negai haruka na yume no shijima ni tokete

22:54.630 --> 23:04.860
You're the wings on my heart, this wish, a distant dream that melts on a deserted island.

23:04.860 --> 23:18.780
All I want is for the bluebird to lead me to you, and drift through the country.

23:19.060 --> 23:26.030
Toward the small sky that weeps.

23:41.530 --> 23:42.580
Oh No!

23:42.950 --> 23:44.700
Ten Commandments is broken.

23:44.730 --> 23:45.540
Hey Haru,

23:45.570 --> 23:49.900
There is a legendary blacksmith
called Musica at Punk Street

23:50.670 --> 23:52.360
Ok, let's go find him and

23:52.360 --> 23:54.240
have him fix Ten Commandments.

23:54.340 --> 23:55.080
Let's Go!!!

23:55.160 --> 23:56.230
Hang on, Haru,

23:56.700 --> 23:58.550
I heard there are two Musicas?

23:58.550 --> 24:00.310
Which is real?

24:00.310 --> 24:01.010
Next Episode of Rave,

24:01.010 --> 24:03.320
The legendary blacksmith Musica

24:03.360 --> 24:04.310
See you soon!
